Faster GLM-5.2 performance

Ollama continues to add capacity for GLM-5.2, =
with up to 2x faster responses than other providers, as measured by =
Ollama=E2=80=99s
sustained average output tokens per second (tps) =
performance with sustained coding workflows over the last 7 days:
=C2=A0

https://ollama.com/library/glm-5.2


Improved coding integrations

Ollama=E2=80=99s docs and coding integrations have been updated for better =
auto-install and configuration support when using GLM-5.2:
=C2=A0
 * VS Code: New official Ollama VS Code extension [https://marketplace.=
visualstudio.com/items?itemName=3DOllama.ollama]

 * Claude Code: =
Auto-install and launch support with GLM-5.2 pre-selected

 * OpenCode: Auto-install, inline configuration, and thinking support

 * Codex & Codex App: More reliable model configuration, model catalogs, =
and restore behavior

 * Oh My Pi: New Oh My Pi (omp) integration with =
included web search support

 * Hermes Desktop: New hermes-desktop =
integration with improved support for agentic coding workflows

=C2=A0
To launch each integration with GLM-5.2, use ollama launch:
=C2=A0

ollama launch claude --model glm-5.2:cloud
ollama launch vscode --model =
glm-5.2:cloud
ollama launch opencode --model glm-5.2:cloud
ollama launch codex-app --model glm-5.2:cloud
ollama launch omp --model =
glm-5.2:cloud
ollama launch hermes-desktop --model glm-5.2:cloud

=C2=A0
For more information, see Ollama's integration documentation [https://docs.=
ollama.com/integrations].
=C2=A0


